      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.pisentius.budge:32-58",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲉⲧⲁⲩϭⲓⲧϥ ⲁⲩϩⲓⲟⲩⲓ **ⲉⲣⲟ**ϥ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲁⲩⲟⲩⲟⲣⲡϥ ⲉϥϣⲟⲩⲓⲧ .",
      "english": "They took him, beat him, and sent him away empty.",
